:name: cepdt Nucleo-F401RE (Phase 8 Task 1)
:description: Headless boot of the cepdt Zephyr firmware on a Renode-simulated Nucleo-F401RE, UART exposed on a host pty.

using sysbus

$name?="nucleo_f401re"
mach create $name

machine LoadPlatformDescription @platforms/cpus/stm32f4.repl

$uart_pty?="/tmp/cepdt_nucleo_f401re_uart"

emulation CreateUartPtyTerminal "term" $uart_pty true
connector Connect sysbus.usart2 term

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""

runMacro $reset

start
